comments.body:
@Der-Schubi Nice job bisecting the issue, much appreciated! :+1: 
@cominixo Thanks for confirming!

The change causing the issue is that previously the "ruffy says" logging was using the _trace_ level, which was not active by default. Since AAPSLogger has no _trace_ level, the refactoring changed it to _debug_, thereby enabling rather verbose logging. The amount of added logging then apparently causes the issue. I've opened PR #1688, which simply removes  those logging calls, which aren't useful to be enabled all the time. This then resolves the issue as demonstrated by @Der-Schubi
